OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FIn 1977, Judy Heumann led an
OL,7,     Fhistoric protest that made
OL,8,     Fdisability discrimination illegal
OL,9,     Fin the US and equality the new
OL,10,     Fstatus quo. Her life story became
OL,11,     Fthe film Being Heumann.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1982, the state of Texas began
OL,14,     Fusing a new method to execute
OL,15,     Fprisoners: lethal injection.
OL,16,     FCharlie Brooks became the first
OL,17,     Fperson to be put to death this
OL,18,     Fway.
